Added new functions to "Era Erm Framework".
  !?FU(Array_SortedUnique);
  ; Leaves only unique sorted integer items in the array.
  ; Calling on [15, 4, 3, 3, 1, 20, 15] list will rearrange and truncate list to the following:
  ; [1, 3, 4, 15, 20]
